    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Copy\nCITY AND COUNTY OF SAN FRANCISCO\nMills Field Municipal Airport of\nSan Francisco\nBill8 - Millbrae Dairy Co.\nFile 531.9\nDecember 22, 1927.\nTo the Honorable\nBoard of Public Works of the\nCity and County of San Francisco.\nGentlemen:\nI transmit herewith bills of the Millbrae Dairy Company'\nagainst the City and County of San Francisco in connection with the\ncutting of grass and other incidental services at the Mills Field\nMunicipal Airport of San Francisco. These services were rendered\nat different times whenever demand was made upon them to level off\nthe field, as conditions warranted such work to be done.\nThese bills have been checked by this office, and have\nmy approval.\nI recommend that your Board request the\nFinance Committee\nof the Board of Supervisors to set aside in the budget for the year\n1928-1929 the sum of $1531 for this purpose.\nAn appropriation requested by this office for this work\nfor the fiscal year 1927-1928 was not included in the budget.\nRespectfully,\nM. M. O'SHAUGHNESSY\nCity Engineer\nWHO: K: H\nEncs.\nBy",
      "-- COPY --\nSan Francisco Municipal Airport\nc/o Mr.\nBurr, City Engineer's Office,\nCity Hall, San Francisco.\nTo Millbrae Dairy, Dr:\nLa bo rer\nARRIL\nTeams\n19\n20\n4\n30\n42\n4\n42\nLaborers\nte ams\n$5.00\n12.00\n$ 20.00\n504.00\n·524.00\nTotal",
